# REST

### Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
}

### Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "registrationToken": "",
    "userInfo": {
        "email": "",
        "firstname": "",
        "lastname": "",
        "password": ""
     }
}

### Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_MOCK_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": ,
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": "",
    "email": ""
}
